# LeakSanitizer suppressions for libFuzzer runs:
#   LSAN_OPTIONS=suppressions=tests/fuzz/lsan.supp
# On macOS the thread libFuzzer starts to watch the RSS limit is still alive
# at exit, so its std::thread state is reported as a leak, and in -fork mode
# that report ends the run.
leak:fuzzer::StartRssThread
